  m_text: "<size=150%><b>YAZAN: LOST CHILD</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=120%><b>A Game
    by IF Games Studio</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Executive Producer</b></size>\r\nMohammad
    Almulla\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Production, Writing </b></size>\r\n<size=90%>Producer,
    Writer</size>\r\nYazeed Ghazwani\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Game Development & Design</b></size>\r\n<size=90%>Game
    Developer, Game Designer & Level Designer</size>\r\nHanan Abdulaziz\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Art
    & Animation</b></size>\r\n<size=90%>2D Artist, Character Concept Artist, Character
    Animator, Asset Artist & Level Designer</size>\r\nWaad Alhuwaiti\r\n\r\n<size=110%><b>Background
    Artist</b></size>\r\nGbeerang\r\n\r\n<size=110%><b>Cutscene Animator, UI/UX Designer
    & Logo Designer</b></size>\r\nMarwan Ali Mirghani\r\n\r\n<size=110%><b>UI/UX
    Designer & English Logo Designer</b></size>\r\nAhdab Alzabidi\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Music</b></size>\r\n<size=90%>Main
    Menu Music Composer</size>\r\nAbdulaziz Alshatb\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Tools &
    Technologies</b></size>\r\n<size=110%><b>Game Engine</b></size>\r\nUnity\r\n\r\n<size=110%><b>Localization
    Tool</b></size>\r\nLingramia by AHAKuo\r\n\r\n<size=130%><b>Special Thanks</b></size>\r\nTo
    all the creators whose work helped bring YAZAN to life.\r\nThank you for sharing
    your creativity with the world.\r\n\r\n\xA9 2026 IF Games Studio. All Rights
    Reserved."
